%% webular — Runtime sequence: every subcommand/flag routes through mise.
%% Source of truth for the CLI -> mise -> Mastra workflow -> FOSS tool flow.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as webular CLI
    participant Router as arg-to-task router
    participant Mise as mise task graph
    participant WF as Mastra Workflow
    participant Tool as Mastra Tool / FOSS adapter
    participant Web as Target web

    User->>CLI: webular scrape URL --format md -o out.md
    CLI->>Router: parse argv and flags (clig.dev)
    Router->>Router: validate with zod, build task ref
    Note over Router,Mise: CLI never calls code directly — every<br/>subcommand, flag and parameter routes to mise
    Router->>Mise: mise run webular:scrape -- --url URL --format md
    Mise->>Mise: resolve depends chain build then scrape (single path)
    Mise->>WF: bun src/commands/scrape.ts (createRun, run.start)
    WF->>Tool: fetch step (Bun.fetch or Playwright)
    Tool->>Web: GET URL
    Web-->>Tool: HTML or PDF bytes
    Tool-->>WF: raw content
    WF->>Tool: clean step (readability + turndown)
    Tool-->>WF: markdown + metadata
    WF-->>Mise: result on stdout (md or --json)
    Mise-->>CLI: exit code + stdout/stderr
    CLI-->>User: rendered TTY output or file via -o
